{"id":"796cdc660bbc6e8a","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-top3-filter-cluster-point.md","title":"ZFC Top3 Filter Cluster Point","display":"df-zfc-top3-filter-cluster-point — ZFC Top3 Filter Cluster Point","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top3-filter-cluster-point","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top3-filter-cluster-point"],"display":"df-zfc-top3-filter-cluster-point — ZFC Top3 Filter Cluster Point","depends_on":["[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-top3-neighborhood-of-point.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top3-filter-cluster-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top3-filter-cluster-point</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top3-filter-cluster-point — ZFC Top3 Filter Cluster Point"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d1121e6ff027ff98\" href=\"?note=d1121e6ff027ff98\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"77925e7596375c07\" href=\"?note=77925e7596375c07\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-top3-neighborhood-of-point.md\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-top3-neighborhood-of-point.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,\\mathcal F,x\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,\\mathcal F,x\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d1121e6ff027ff98\" href=\"?note=d1121e6ff027ff98\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop3NeighborhoodOfPoint}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop3NeighborhoodOfPoint}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"77925e7596375c07\" href=\"?note=77925e7596375c07\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-top3-neighborhood-of-point.md\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-top3-neighborhood-of-point.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop3FilterClusterPoint}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop3FilterClusterPoint}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top3\\text{-}filter\\text{-}cluster\\text{-}point}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop3FilterClusterPoint}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal F,x)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S(\\mathcal F,X)\n\\land x\\in X\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall N\\subseteq X\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop3NeighborhoodOfPoint}_S(X,\\tau,x,N)\n\\to\\forall F\\in\\mathcal F\\;(N\\cap F\\neq\\varnothing)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top3\\text{-}filter\\text{-}cluster\\text{-}point}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop3FilterClusterPoint}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal F,x)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S(\\mathcal F,X)\n\\land x\\in X\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall N\\subseteq X\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop3NeighborhoodOfPoint}_S(X,\\tau,x,N)\n\\to\\forall F\\in\\mathcal F\\;(N\\cap F\\neq\\varnothing)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A cluster point meets every member of the filter in every neighborhood, not merely in the open neighborhoods named directly by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter.md","status":"resolved","id":"d1121e6ff027ff98","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-zfc-top3-neighborhood-of-point.md","status":"resolved","id":"77925e7596375c07","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-top3-neighborhood-of-point.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter.md","status":"resolved","id":"d1121e6ff027ff98","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch09/58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-zfc-top3-neighborhood-of-point.md","status":"resolved","id":"77925e7596375c07","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop3NeighborhoodOfPoint}_S\\subseteq V^4$ (see [[../batch04/58-df-zfc-top3-neighborhood-of-point.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau,\\mathcal F,x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop3NeighborhoodOfPoint}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop3FilterClusterPoint}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top3\\text{-}filter\\text{-}cluster\\text{-}point}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop3FilterClusterPoint}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal F,x)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S(\\mathcal F,X)\n\\land x\\in X\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall N\\subseteq X\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop3NeighborhoodOfPoint}_S(X,\\tau,x,N)\n\\to\\forall F\\in\\mathcal F\\;(N\\cap F\\neq\\varnothing)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false}],"bytes":1564,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3554","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-top3-filter-cluster-point.md|58-df-zfc-top3-filter-cluster-point]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["74086485fba8d86f","d1121e6ff027ff98","77925e7596375c07"]}